WEBVTT

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:00.973
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:01.333 --> 00:00:02.886
Verb phrases

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.367
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1, B

00:00:05.933 --> 00:00:11.234
<v><b>F:</b></v> Fashion has come full circle, and long skirts are now back, like in the 70s.

00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:13.715
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2, A

00:00:14.603 --> 00:00:19.590
<v><b>M:</b></v> Our dog needs a ridiculous amount of food. He’s eating us out of house and home.

00:00:20.786 --> 00:00:22.587
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3, G

00:00:23.438 --> 00:00:28.065
<v><b>F:</b></v> I could tell immediately that Jackie was upset. She wears her heart on her sleeve.

00:00:29.385 --> 00:00:31.113
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4, C

00:00:31.967 --> 00:00:36.605
<v><b>M:</b></v> I thought it was best that I told Matt what I knew about his new girlfriend.

00:00:36.938 --> 00:00:39.222
Sometimes you have to be cruel to be kind.

00:00:40.615 --> 00:00:42.576
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5, I

00:00:43.536 --> 00:00:46.439
<v><b>F:</b></v> The boss is furious with you about yesterday’s meeting.

00:00:46.772 --> 00:00:49.799
I think you should lie low this morning and keep out of his way.

00:00:51.179 --> 00:00:53.054
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6, F

00:00:53.889 --> 00:00:56.760
<v><b>M:</b></v> A man turned up at the door pretending to be a policeman

00:00:56.813 --> 00:01:00.396
and tried to convince my grandmother to give him her credit card details.

00:01:00.739 --> 00:01:03.290
Luckily, I was there, and I sent him packing.

00:01:04.718 --> 00:01:06.596
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7, H

00:01:07.485 --> 00:01:11.519
<v><b>F:</b></v> Telling a joke is a good way to break the ice at the start of a presentation.

00:01:12.743 --> 00:01:14.422
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8, D

00:01:15.258 --> 00:01:19.746
<v><b>M:</b></v> I drank far too much coffee yesterday, and as a result I didn’t sleep a wink.

00:01:21.098 --> 00:01:22.967
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9, E

00:01:23.864 --> 00:01:29.067
<v><b>F:</b></v> Nobody knows what happened to the missing walkers. They seem to have vanished into thin air.